# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern
README.md

# Hand-written webhook signature verifier (Fern's generated verifier can't parse the compound
# `ElevenLabs-Signature: t=...,v0=...` header). Standalone rather than a method on the generated
# WebhooksClient, which Java can't extend without freezing that whole generated file.
src/main/java/com/elevenlabs/api/webhooks/
src/test/java/com/elevenlabs/api/webhooks/

# Hand-written Flows createAndWait helpers (start an image/video/text-to-speech generation or a
# template run, then poll the generated get until it is completed or failed, honouring the
# server's Retry-After). Java has no partial classes, and the generated Flows clients are rewritten
# on every regeneration, so this is a separate entry point (FlowsWaiter) that sends through the
# generated clients' withRawResponse(), the only path that exposes the Retry-After header.
src/main/java/com/elevenlabs/api/flows/wait/
src/test/java/com/elevenlabs/api/flows/wait/
